This plugin assesses a Snowflake estate and migrates its structure onto Oracle
AI Data Platform through the control plane, which copies no data. Table rows
are copied only by the in-AIDP job snowmig_02_copy_schema (INSERT-SELECT,
verified by row count and decimal sums), one schema per run, when the operator
runs it.

